msgid "dbt's hosted platform adds live semantic APIs, scheduled exports, caching and ready-made BI integrations, but neither implementation depends on it. Questions we know in advance are answered from generated tables, and ad-hoc questions go through the engine-native objects or a service built on MetricFlow. We're also tracking [Apache Ossie]{1}, an open format for exchanging semantic definitions. Once dbt and the engines that consume the definitions support the same released version of it, it can replace the generators."
